                  "id": "m-038",
                  "text": {
                    "en": [
                      {
                        "text": "A rise in the price of a good changes the quantity demanded of that good along its demand curve, but a change in income shifts the whole curve."
                      }
                    ],
                    "zh": [
                      {
                        "text": "貨品價格上升，會令該貨品的需求量沿需求曲線變動；而收入改變，則會令整條曲線移位。"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
